sequenceDiagram
  participant CR as node-cron
  participant NS as Notification service
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant JL as Join link service
  participant WA as Vonage Messages
  participant IO as Socket.IO
  participant A as Admin SPA
  actor G as Guest
  participant J as Join API
  participant V as Vonage Video
  CR->>NS: Poll due bookings and reminders
  NS->>DB: Find eligible reservations
  DB-->>NS: Confirmed reservations
  NS->>JL: Issue link for due booking
  JL->>DB: Store expiring JoinToken
  NS->>WA: WhatsApp notice with due-time link
  NS->>IO: Emit reservation event
  IO-->>A: Live admin notification
  G->>J: POST /sessions/join/:tokenId
  J->>DB: Atomically consume one-time token
  J->>V: Issue guest publisher token
  V-->>J: Video connection credentials
  J-->>G: token, sessionId, applicationId
  G->>V: Join using Video Client SDK
  V-->>J: Session and archive monitoring webhooks
